            {
                "content": "```\nInput: nums = [4,2,5,3]\nOutput: 7\nExplanation: It is optimal to choose the subsequence [4,2,5] with alternating sum (4 + 5) - 2 = 7.\n```"
            },
            {
                "content": "```\nInput: nums = [5,6,7,8]\nOutput: 8\nExplanation: It is optimal to choose the subsequence [8] with alternating sum 8.\n```"
